in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights    A monumental Latin Cross Catholic Basilica built in a high-resolution voxel engine, specifically the Luanti engine. Wide-angle epic architectural shot. The building is made of bright white marble blocks, featuring a massive central dome covered in golden mosaics, and a towering 95-meter tall bell tower with an oxidized green copper spire on the left. The main facade has a giant, intricately glowing gothic stained glass rose window and monumental bronze doors. Warm, realistic volumetric lighting spilling out from the windows into a serene sunset environment. High-resolution voxel textures, similar to Luanti's 'Realism 512' texture pack. Elegantly integrated into the foreground or the sky, the bold majestic text "BASÍLICA DE CRUZ LATINA" and the subtitle "exploration_catholic_church" in a classic, glowing golden serif typography. Architectural focus, majestic, peaceful.
